        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes the volume integral over the element interpolation functions times the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operand" kindref="compound">Operand</ref>. If the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operand" kindref="compound">Operand</ref> is 1 over the element, then the volume integral is naturally 1 as well. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>accumulation takes place only for faces where the Material <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operand" kindref="compound">Operand</ref> is flagged Neumann. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
